msgstr "Accepter l'invitation"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/invitation_accept.html:13
msgid ""
"Choose a password of at least 12 characters. Administrators and material "
"managers then set up a second factor when they first sign in."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez un mot de passe d'au moins 12 caractères. Les administrateurs et "
"chargés de matériel configurent ensuite un second facteur lors de leur "
"première connexion."

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/invitation_accept.html:16
msgid "Set password and accept"
msgstr "Définir le mot de passe et accepter"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/invitation_accept.html:18
msgid ""
"Your account receives the access in this invitation. Your password and "
"second factor do not change."
msgstr ""
"Votre compte reçoit l'accès de cette invitation. Votre mot de passe et votre "
"second facteur ne changent pas."

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/invitation_accept.html:19
msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Accepter"

